# Normalise line endings: keep LF in the repo on every platform so a Windows
# checkout doesn't churn diffs, trip `rustfmt --check` / `biome`, or alter the
# `include_str!`'d agent prompt. Binary assets are marked so Git never touches them.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.surql text eol=lf
